          "disambiguationNote": "Hananiah (Jehovah has given. A chief of the tribe of Benjamin ( 1 Chronicles 8:24 ). One of the sons of Heman ( 1 Chronicles 25:4 1 Chronicles 25:23 ). One of Uzziah's military officers ( 2 Chronicles 26:11 ). Grandfather of the captain who arrested Jeremiah ( Jeremiah 37:13 ). Jeremiah 36:12 . Nehemiah 10:23 . Shadrach, one of the \"three Hebrew children\" (Dan. 1; 6:7 ). Son of Zerubbabel ( 1 Chronicles 3:19 1 Chronicles 3:21 ). Ezra 10:28 . The \"ruler of the palace; he was a faithful man, and feared God above many\" ( Nehemiah 7:2 ). Nehemiah 3:8 . Nehemiah 3:30 A priest, son of Jeremiah ( Nehemiah 12:12 ). A false prophet contemporary with ( Jeremiah 28:3 Jeremiah 28:17 ).)",
